DUSD::setPauser()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when setting pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    │   ├── when setting status to true
    │   │   └── it should enable pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    │       ├── it should emit PauserUpdated event
    │       └── it should set pauser for PAUSE_TYPE to true
    │   └── when setting status to false
    │       ├── it should emit PauserUpdated event
    │       └── it should set pauser for PAUSE_TYPE to false
    ├── when setting pauser for CUSTOM_PAUSE_TYPE
    │   ├── when setting status to true
    │   │   └── it should enable pauser for CUSTOM_PAUSE_TYPE
    │       ├── it should emit PauserUpdated event
    │       └── it should set pauser for CUSTOM_PAUSE_TYPE to true
    │   └── when setting status to false
    │       ├── it should disable pauser for CUSTOM_PAUSE_TYPE
    │       ├── it should emit PauserUpdated event
    │       └── it should set pauser for CUSTOM_PAUSE_TYPE to false